    <!-- Privacy -->
    <string name="today_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="today_privacy_health">Migas is a personal app with no server and no accounts. It reads from Health Connect the calories, weight, steps, sleep, resting heart rate and workouts your watch\'s app writes (Garmin Connect, Samsung Health, Fitbit…), only to show them and work out your daily target.</string>
    <string name="today_privacy_water">It writes to Health Connect the water you log and the weight you import from a CSV. No health data leaves your phone, except what you export.</string>
    <string name="today_privacy_ai">If you set up the AI, the phrases you dictate and the photos of labels and dishes are sent to the provider you choose (NanoGPT or Anthropic, the company behind Claude) to interpret them; never Health Connect data.</string>
